      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-02T14:45:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, Adam already does ALL of the art himself in a very short amount of time. Yes, it would be super cool, but I'm already whipping him to the point of exhaustion as is. Rather than do 220 arts for one expansion, 220 arts could be two expansions. Would you rather have every card with unique art, or more than one game every other year?</p>",
